---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`${SITE_NAMES[lang]} legal notice: publisher, host and terms of use`} description="Publisher and host of Hours Ledger, why hours and pay shown are estimates and not legal advice, intellectual property, embedding of the time card and governing law." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Legal notice and terms of use</h1>
    <p>Information given under Article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004, the publisher being established in France.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Estimates, not legal advice</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAMES[lang]} adds up hours and computes gross pay under federal and state wage-hour rules as published by the agencies cited on each page. It is not a payroll service, a law firm or a government agency. A result on this site creates no obligation for anyone; what you are owed depends on your employment status, your employer's fixed workweek, written agreements and decisions of the competent agency or court. The method and its limits are on the <a href={route('method', lang)}>method page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2><p>Rules are read from official texts and the calculators are tested before each release, yet errors cannot be ruled out and data age. The publisher is not liable for a decision made on an estimate alone. Please report any error through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Texts, design and code belong to the publisher; short quotations with a link back are welcome. Federal statutes, regulations and agency publications quoted on the site are public domain works; state texts are cited with their source.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The time card and the military time converter may be embedded for free with their credit link visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>The site sets no cookie and keeps nothing you type in the calculators. Details: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reporting unlawful content</h2><p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the address of the page.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law applies; failing an amicable settlement, the courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction} have jurisdiction. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
